Description: CVE-2024-7254 — official fix from protocolbuffers/protobuf d6c82fc55a76481c676f541a255571e8950bb8c3
 Recursion limit when parsing unknown groups/fields (official d6c82fc / 3.25.5).
 .
 Java-only hunks rewritten from java/core/src/main/java/... to
 src/main/java/... so they apply to Maven Central -sources.jar layout.
 Changed: CodedInputStream.java, InvalidProtocolBufferException.java, ArrayDecoders.java, UnknownFieldSchema.java, MessageSchema.java, MessageSetSchema.java.
Origin: backport, https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/commit/d6c82fc55a76481c676f541a255571e8950bb8c3
Bug: https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-7254
Last-Update: 2026-09-10
 Detach from protobuf-parent: parent imports protobuf-bom at ${project.version},
 which becomes the branded aikido/root.io version and is unpublished. Standalone
 POM with explicit GAV + compiler source/target so versions:set branding works.
 .

